        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Son of man, behold, I will take away from you the desire of your eyes with one stroke; yet you shall neither mourn nor weep, neither shall your tears run down.",
      "ko": "인자야 내가 네 눈에 기뻐하는 것을 한번 쳐서 빼앗으리니 너는 슬퍼 하거나 울거나 눈물을 흘리거나 하지 말며",
      "source_text_hash": "6e63e58811b1358b847fb73e7faa88ad34514aa4dff72d7b7384fc787ae6a224",
      "translation_text_hash": "61d6641886b94280b37567741439275ca877e23668d43a363049a4e2a4975d21",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
