      "en": "Then I said to them, “The LORD’s word came to me, saying,",
      "ko": "내가 그들에게 대답하기를 여호와의 말씀이 내게 임하여 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "d680fe54c0f07d0918f267565fbdec7371a228f92bcc1767cf2236148fc059c6",
      "translation_text_hash": "085a3e5645f39b260e1e7f2bd5ab06bafe5603745c93bc51d2c05e4f3e9b1c1a",
